		(descr "SOIC-8 with exposed pad, 1.27 mm pitch. The 2.41 x 3.05 mm land is larger than the package's 2.29 x 2.29 mm exposed pad and is kept for heat spreading. Exposed-pad paste: 2 x 2 roundrect panes, 1.0 mm on 1.25 mm pitch, centred on the package pad, about 3.8 mm2 (72 % of the package pad) with 0.25 mm gaps so flux can escape. Paste over the whole land printed 1.4 x the package pad's area; replaced 2026-09-28.")
